# Only build inputs may enter the context, even when state lives in the checkout.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**

# State/secrets must remain excluded even if accidentally placed under src/.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config.toml
**/accounts.json
**/credentials
**/reasoning.key
**/registry.lock
**/locks
**/logs
**/*.log
